## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates practical data protection across SAP on AWS with Snowflake analytics, balancing real-time access and compliance.

## Key Concepts
- SAP S/4HANA data ingestion and masking
- Field-level masking rules for PII
- Snowflake masking policies and data sharing
- AWS KMS key management and IAM governance
- Auditing, rollback, and failover strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example masking function
function maskPII(record) {
  const r = {...record};
  if (r.email) r.email = r.email.replace(/(.{2}).+(@.*)/, '$1***$2');
  if (r.phone) r.phone = r.phone.replace(/(\d{3})\d{4}(\d{3})/, '$1***$2');
  if (r.ssn) r.ssn = '***-**-' + r.ssn.slice(-4);
  return r;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you validate masking without leaking data in logs?
- How would you rotate keys and propagate policy changes across Snowflake without downtime?

## Why This Is Asked
This question introduces hands-on observability basics for SAP on AWS, covering log shipping, custom metrics, and alerting.

## Key Concepts
- CloudWatch Logs and CloudWatch Agent for centralized log management
- PutMetricData API for publishing custom metrics like SAP_CPU_GT_85
- CloudWatch Alarms for threshold-based alerting
- SNS for reliable notification delivery
- CloudFormation for Infrastructure as Code (IAM role and alarm creation)

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Resources": {
    "SAPCloudWatchLogsRole": {
      "Type": "AWS::IAM::Role",
      "Properties": {
        "AssumeRolePolicyDocument": {
          "Version": "2012-10-17",
          "Statement": [{
            "Effect": "Allow",
            "Principal": {"Service": "ec2.amazonaws.com"},
            "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
          }]
        },
        "ManagedPolicyArns": ["arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy"]
      }
    },
    "SAPCPUAlarm": {
      "Type": "AWS::CloudWatch::Alarm",
      "Properties": {
        "AlarmName": "SAP_CPU_GT_85",
        "MetricName": "SAP_CPU_GT_85",
        "Namespace": "SAP/Application",
        "Statistic": "Maximum",
        "Period": 300,
        "EvaluationPeriods": 1,
        "Threshold": 85,
        "ComparisonOperator": "GreaterThanThreshold",
        "AlarmActions": [{"Ref": "SAPSNSTopic"}],
        "TreatMissingData": "notBreaching"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
